    "sub_id": "57550",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>The midterm exam accounts for 30% of the final grade, the final exam accounts for 40%, and regular performance accounts for 30%, totaling 100%.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<th>評分規則說明</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>The midterm report accounts for 30% of the final grade, the final report accounts for 40%, and regular performance accounts for 30%, totaling 100%.</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
    "course_pol": "Classroom Rules\nAttendance is very important. While students are not required to attend every class, frequent absences will definitely affect the final grade and may even result in failing the course.\nTo avoid disrupting other students' learning, please keep your voice low when having private conversations in class. If the volume is too loud, I will remind you.\nIf you miss the midterm exam, you must provide a valid leave request. Make-up exams due to sick leave, bereavement leave, or other major reasons will be graded based on the make-up exam score. If the absence is unexcused, the make-up exam score will be reduced by 20%.\n\n課堂規則\n出席會是一件很重要的事.雖然同學不被強制要求每堂課都要到課,但經常性的缺席一定會影響學期成績,甚至不及格.\n為了避免影響其他同學學習狀況,在課堂上私下說話交談時務必壓低音量.若音量太大,我會提醒同學.\n期中考缺考需有請假證明.因病假喪假或重大理由補考後以補考分數計算,若無故缺考,補考分數打八折計算.",
    "course_pol_en": "Classroom Rules\nAttendance is very important. While students are not required to attend every class, frequent absences will definitely affect the final grade and may even result in failing the course.\nTo avoid disrupting other students' learning, please keep your voice low when having private conversations in class. If the volume is too loud, I will remind you.\nIf you miss the midterm exam, you must provide a valid leave request. Make-up exams due to sick leave, bereavement leave, or other major reasons will be graded based on the make-up exam score. If the absence is unexcused, the make-up exam score will be reduced by 20%.\n\n課堂規則\n出席會是一件很重要的事.雖然同學不被強制要求每堂課都要到課,但經常性的缺席一定會影響學期成績,甚至不及格.\n為了避免影響其他同學學習狀況,在課堂上私下說話交談時務必壓低音量.若音量太大,我會提醒同學.\n期中考缺考需有請假證明.因病假喪假或重大理由補考後以補考分數計算,若無故缺考,補考分數打八折計算.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>Midterm and final exams, as well as class attendance (including practical sessions), are key factors affecting your semester grade. Please make sure to take note of this.</div>\n\n<div>期中期末考以及上課出席(含實習課)是影響學期成績的關鍵.請同學們務必注意.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<div>Class attendance is a key factor influencing the final grade. If you attend regularly, you should be able to pass the course. This semester, group presentations will be conducted for the midterm and final, serving as another primary basis for evaluation.</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div>上課出席是影響學期成績的關鍵.如果平常都能出席,基本上這顆就能通過.本學期期中期末進行小組報告,做為另一主要評分依據.</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
